    <string name="welcome_start">Get started</string>
    <string name="welcome_1_title">Send photos at full resolution</string>
    <string name="welcome_1_text">Messaging and social apps compress the photos you send. Share them from here as files and they arrive exactly as you took them.</string>
    <string name="welcome_2_title">Front Row</string>
    <string name="welcome_2_text">Put photos in the Front Row and they come first in the photo picker of your messaging and social apps, ready to send.</string>
    <string name="welcome_3_title">Tools and help</string>
    <string name="welcome_3_text">The toolbox at the top sorts, finds similar photos and compares them. ⋮ › Help shows how everything works.</string>
